ate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (ultrafilter-extension predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter-ext} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S(U,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ultrafilter-ext} \\vdash \\mathrm{UltrafilterExtension}_S(U,\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,X)\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every filter extends to an ultrafilter is the extension theorem for this relation.</li>\n<li>This theorem is equivalent to the Boolean prime ideal theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../ba